{"id": "thyssenkrupp-2026-05-14-025", "date": "2026-05-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 20, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["thyssenkrupp"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["carbon_emissions", "raw_material_energy_cost"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "thyssenkrupp launches thyssenkrupp Calvion", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/thyssenkrupp-calvion-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Germany</strong>: thyssenkrupp has launched thyssenkrupp Calvion, a new company focused on industrial decarbonisation technologies including oxyfuel, direct air capture, quicklime and phosphogypsum recycling. The company said that thyssenkrupp Calvion comprises a team with expertise in industrial process technologies, large-scale plant engineering, flash calcination and CO₂ solutions.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/20767-thyssenkrupp-launches-thyssenkrupp-calvion", "type": "rss"}]}
